# Read by Vite during `npm run build` only. The dev server does not use it:
# `vite.config.ts` proxies /api to 127.0.0.1:8000, so development stays
# same-origin and this value is ignored there.
#
# This is a public URL, not a secret - it ends up in the shipped bundle by
# design, which is why the file is committed. No key ever belongs here.
#
# !! VERIFY THIS AFTER CREATING THE RENDER SERVICE !!
# Render derives the hostname from the service name in render.yaml
# (`promo-finder`), but appends a suffix if that name is already taken
# globally. Open the service in the dashboard, copy the URL it actually shows,
# and correct this line before building. A wrong value here is a frontend that
# loads perfectly and cannot reach anything.
VITE_API_BASE=https://promo-finder.onrender.com
